#: plasmoid/org.rodada.headphones/contents/ui/main.qml:419
msgid ""
"Connect the headphones over Bluetooth. If they are also connected to a "
"phone, close the headphones app there (Sound Connect, Galaxy Wearable)."
msgstr ""
"Подключите наушники по Bluetooth. Если они подключены и к телефону, закройте "
"там приложение наушников (Sound Connect, Galaxy Wearable)."

#: plasmoid/org.rodada.headphones/contents/ui/main.qml:420
msgid ""
"Start it with:\n"
"systemctl --user start headphonesd"
msgstr ""
"Запустите её командой:\n"
"systemctl --user start headphonesd"

#: plasmoid/org.rodada.headphones/contents/ui/main.qml:442
msgid ""
"The headphones ask to confirm this change. They may disconnect for a moment."
msgstr ""
"Наушники просят подтвердить изменение. Они могут ненадолго отключиться."

